Key parameters varied in Monte Carlo simulations:

Parameter Range Distribution
τ_EMP^(cross-border) baseline 0.40–0.65 Uniform
τ_KNW 0.50–0.85 Uniform
τ_SOC 0.35–0.65 Uniform
ρ_initial (non-OECD) 0.15–0.40 Uniform
λ (lobbying decay) 0.05–0.20 Uniform
θ_F threshold 0.3–0.6 Normal(0.45,0.1)
